This ISO includes your custom configurations and dotfiles.

Installation steps:
  1. Connect to Wi-Fi (if needed): iwctl
  2. The full installer starts automatically on TTY1
     (Manual fallback: ./install-hifam.sh)
  3. Reboot: umount -R /mnt && reboot

Your configs will be in /usr/share/hifam after installation.

Documentation: /root/README.md  |  Configs: /root/hifam-config/
